Self-contained documentation assets
====================================

These files are exact snapshots of small development-tree inputs referenced by
Sphinx literal-includes or download links. Keeping the copies below docs/
allows NCAR/CheMPAS-A-Docs to build independently of the private qualification
repository. They preserve provenance for the rendered documentation; they do
not expand the supported contents of the public CheMPAS-A MVP source release.

Source mapping:

* tutorial/abba_box.py <- scripts/musica_python/abba_box.py
* tutorial/abba.yaml <- micm_configs/abba.yaml
* mvp/* <- the corresponding scripts/, test_cases/global_mvp/, or
  miem_configs/ file
* global-methane/scenarios.yaml <- test_cases/global_methane_miem/scenarios.yaml

The files use the project license supplied with the source and documentation
repositories.
